* COUNT DEMO
* -----------
* Minimal arithmetic and variables. Note this program does NOT loop --
* LOOP is just a label that is never branched to. It prints:
*   1   (initial N)
*   2   (after N = N + 1)
*   3   (N + 1, evaluated inline; N itself stays at 2)
       N = 1
LOOP   OUTPUT = N
       N = N + 1
       OUTPUT = N
       OUTPUT = N + 1
END
